requirements:
Under Part 3 Amendment 1, the maximum sound levels for three-wheelers are:
a) Vehicles with engine capacity <= 175 cc (thermic) or battery-operated vehicles (including E-rickshaws, E-carts): 76 dB(A);
b) Vehicles with engine capacity > 175 cc (thermic): 80 dB(A).

Maximum sound limits for L2 category motorcycles are:
a) Engine displacement <= 80 cc: 75 dB(A);
b) 80 cc < Displacement <= 175 cc: 77 dB(A);
c) Displacement > 175 cc: 80 dB(A).
